  <h2>About</h2>
  <p>I am The Instant Camera Guy, an ABN registered sole trader specializing in the sales, servicing, restoration and modification of classic Polaroid cameras.</p>
  <p>I also occasionally restore other film cameras such as the Mamiya C series and Graflex Speed Graphics, but I specialize mainly in Polaroids. Since I mainly focus on client repairs, I don’t regularly sell refurbished cameras.</p>
  <p>However, occasionally I will find, restore and sell them on. Cameras for sale are typically listed on my Facebook page. I ship Australia wide. If you are overseas, no worries! I ship pretty much anywhere! Just ask me for a quote!</p>
  <p>All cameras I sell are guaranteed to work and come with a 6 months comprehensive warranty.</p>
